# Tailwind

- Colors come from the `@theme` tokens in `app/globals.css`: `primary`, `secondary`, `tertiary`.
- When the same class string appears twice, export one constant or use one component.
- Do not add a wrapper that only renames a single element.

```tsx
// ❌ the same classes copied onto every anchor
<a className="text-primary underline decoration-secondary" href="/about">

// ✅
<TextLink href="/about">About</TextLink>
```
